**_BUT_**, I have been reviewing this again, and I do see some issues; some minor nits, but one big problem actually:

If someone decides to promote inlining to mir-opt-level 1, that's the default opt level, and now `-Zinstrument-coverage` will fail without any other flags! I agree that's bad, so in effect, the `error` in `config.rs` will (without other changes) prevent promoting inling to mir-opt-level 1!

